		{
			dependencies: ["06742EB86FD93B67"]
			description: [
				"&7To unlock the rest of the welcome tab, confirm this quest was read with the checkmark above."
				""
				"Here in &dThe Factory Must Grow&r, you will be delighted with all the options open to you for building &aquickly&r, &arobustly&r, and most importantly, with &bstyle and beauty&r."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The &a4 attached quests&r point towards general catagories."
				""
				"&b&nStructural&r - Building \\& Scrapping mechanics."
				""
				"&b&nMass Construction&r - I don't think I need to explain this one."
				""
				"&b&nMovement&r - Getting around your base quickly."
				""
				"&b&nLogistics Management&r - Getting stuff that isn't you around your base quickly."
			]
