		{
			dependencies: ["5F964897DC3F3EF8"]
			description: [
				"Getting items around your base &aefficiently&r is not difficult on an &nindividual recipe level&r."
				""
				"The difficulty comes when &ecross connecting&r production areas and &6maintaining stock&r of everything at once while also &cpreventing overflow&r or bottlenecks."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Thankfully &dLogistics Management&r has your back with all the infrastructure needed to maintain less spaghetti than normal."
			]
