		{
			dependencies: ["5F964897DC3F3EF8"]
			description: [
				"Factories are much more than the machines inside. The &l&6physical skeleton&r of the structure itself needs attention to ensure &aproper expandability&r."
				""
				"More importantly as well is to make things &dpretty&r. This may seem like a waste but a pretty base is a base you'll want to work in."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"If you lawn base I will remove all of your bones."
