		{
			dependencies: ["400105EB08904710"]
			description: [
				"Chests! Oh glorious Chest!"
				""
				"Can be &nsolo or double&r as I'm sure is known."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Besides the obvious storage applications, chests can act as &abuffers&r for continous automation tasks."
				""
				"For example slapping a chest directly on the output of a &6cobblestone generator&r can act as a buffer to better tolerate spikes in demand.  "
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"In addition the chest can be read by a comparator to &6auto-shut-off&r the cobblegen once sufficiently full."
				""
				"More information on comparators on the quest to the &n→ right →&r, there you see it right? Ok."
			]
			id: "4FB68561130B82C9"
			rewards: [{
