		{
			dependencies: [
				"3B1C0DC00EC8C081"
				"3BEACE9F3F1EC3AA"
			]
			description: [
				"So many structures strwen about! What to do with them?"
				""
				"Because the dev team &7(one person)&r is insane, all decorative blocks are now subject to &6a scrapping system!&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Decorative elements in structures have &n2 routes&r to processing them."
				""
				"&l1)&r &bSawing&r them into a &6matter ball&r of a designated flavor."
				""
				"&l2)&r &bSmashing&r them into their component parts."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The distinction between &nsawing and smashing&r ensures that any decorative element can be \"&are-rolled&r\" into any other decorative element of its respective \"level\"."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"This also means decorative elements can have &atier-gated&r recipes but still remain somewhat accessible."
				""
				"The real treat from this as well is that given a &blucky enough find&r you can gain access to materials well &cb&6e&ey&ao&bn&dd&r your tech level."
			]
			id: "4A8BE783CC23F0B5"
			rewards: [{
				id: "2781E3A082852204"
				item: "nyagibits_bytes:tier_zero_strawberry"
